sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Proxy as Routing Sidecar<br/>8080/TCP
    participant PDRouter as P/D Router<br/>chatCompletionsHandler
    participant Validator as AllowlistValidator<br/>SSRF Protection
    participant Decoder as vLLM Decoder<br/>(co-located)
    participant Prefiller as Prefiller Instance<br/>(remote pod)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS

    Note over Validator, K8sAPI: Startup: Build Allowlist
    Validator->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool<br/>(inference.networking.x-k8s.io/v1alpha2)
    K8sAPI-->>Validator: InferencePool events
    Validator->>K8sAPI: Watch Pods<br/>(label selectors from pool)
    K8sAPI-->>Validator: Pod add/update/delete events
    Note over Validator: Rebuild pod IP allowlist<br/>on every pod event

    Note over Client, Prefiller: Flow 1: Health Check
    Client->>Route: GET /health (HTTPS)
    Route->>Proxy: GET /health (HTTP/8080)
    Proxy-->>Route: 200 OK
    Route-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client, Prefiller: Flow 2: P/D Disaggregated Inference
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions (HTTPS)<br/>Headers: x-prefiller-url, x-request-id
    Route->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions (HTTP/8080)
    Proxy->>PDRouter: Inspect headers & body<br/>(x-prefiller-url, do_remote_prefill,<br/>kv_transfer_params)
    PDRouter->>Validator: Validate prefiller target IP
    Validator-->>PDRouter: Allowed (IP in allowlist)
    PDRouter->>Prefiller: Proxy request<br/>(TLS 1.2+, ECDHE ciphers)
    Prefiller-->>PDRouter: Prefill response
    PDRouter-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: JSON Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client, Prefiller: Flow 3: Direct Decode (catch-all)
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/completions (HTTPS)
    Route->>Proxy: POST /v1/completions (HTTP/8080)
    Proxy->>Decoder: Reverse proxy (LRU cached handler)
    Decoder-->>Proxy: Inference result
    Proxy-->>Route: JSON Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client, Prefiller: Flow 4: SSRF Rejection
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions (HTTPS)<br/>Header: x-prefiller-url=malicious-ip
    Route->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions (HTTP/8080)
    Proxy->>PDRouter: Inspect headers
    PDRouter->>Validator: Validate target IP
    Validator-->>PDRouter: Rejected (IP not in allowlist)
    PDRouter-->>Proxy: Error response
    Proxy-->>Route: 403 Forbidden
    Route-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
